             improbable          |                                            
        -2   [-2] Does not apply |     216061      32.58      32.58      32.59
        -1   [-1] No Answer      |        964       0.15       0.15      32.73
        1906                     |         21       0.00       0.00      32.74
        1923                     |          3       0.00       0.00      32.74
